#: ../../source/index.rst:7 a09cea390f56431dbc0ddfdd0b95b865
msgid "Welcome to DingoDB Docs!"
msgstr "欢迎来到 DingoDB 产品手册！"

#: ../../source/index.rst:9 382284edf14944b3ac5a38ff29e1f9fc
msgid ""
"Here you will learn about what DingoDB is, and how to install and deploy "
"DingoDB to build an application according to your need."
msgstr ""
"在这里，您将了解到 DingoDB 的概况和特性，以及如何安装部署 DingoDB 以根据实"
"际需求构建应用程序。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:15 a1649a1e8b0d410384d903d00869fbf7
msgid "About DingoDB"
msgstr "关于DingoDB"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20 dd475fb8bc214f039759784be7cf1a47
msgid ""
"The AI-Native multimodal database provides strongly consistent storage for "
"relational, vector, text, and other multimodal data, while offering SQL-"
"based unified analysis capabilities across multiple modalities."
msgstr ""
"面向AI-Native的多模数据库，提供关系、向量、文本等多模态强一致性数据存储，提"
"供基于SQL的多模态联合分析能力。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:23 b2ce2c893c5c48f195b7e70ce4c37232
msgid "Product Advantages"
msgstr "产品优势"

#: ../../source/index.rst:26 a7ca522020354e2bada44bd11c41f9df
msgid "Enterprise Storage Reliability"
msgstr "企业级存储可靠性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:28 a3285c1a8c1f4528a28b689bc0abc2bd
msgid ""
"Based on Multi-Raft multi-copy storage, ensuring data strong consistency "
"and meeting enterprise-level disaster recovery requirements."
msgstr "基于Multi-Raft多副本存储，确保数据强一致性，满足企业级容灾需求。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:30 4b4f26bbf26f45c7a7b76ba95c37f92d
msgid "Scalar-Vector Joint Retrieval"
msgstr "标量向量联合检索"

#: ../../source/index.rst:32 1f2fec32dd6c493a89502c66a55846b3
msgid ""
"Supports SQL execution of scalar and vector joint retrieval, provides a "
"variety of vector index types, simplifies the development complexity of "
"RAG applications, and meets various scenario requirements."
msgstr ""
"支持SQL执行标量与向量的联合检索，并提供丰富的向量索引类型，简化RAG应用的开"
"发复杂度，满足各种场景需求。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:34 5a6a3a96a4d943d396104b4e5f4869b4
msgid "Multi-Modal Database Capabilities"
msgstr "多模数据库能力"

#: ../../source/index.rst:36 1b6af0d53df34d1fa6769727ae0d15d9
msgid ""
"Deploying a set of DingoDB can have the service capabilities of Key-Value "
"cache acceleration, relational database, and vector database, reduce the "
"maintenance and management costs of multiple database systems, and improve "
"the efficiency and flexibility of the overall system."
msgstr ""
"部署一套DingoDB即可拥有Key-Value缓存加速、关系数据库和向量数据库的服务能"
"力，减少多个数据库系统的维护和管理成本，提高整体系统的效率和灵活性。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:38 1576ff0357ce413aa8b71ccb237dcf0f
msgid "Compatible with MySQL Protocol"
msgstr "兼容MySQL协议"

#: ../../source/index.rst:40 891f6c8037d54f87afde5bdf4b31f0f3
msgid ""
"DingoDB is compatible with the MySQL protocol, users can directly access "
"DingoDB using the MySQL client, without the need to learn new database "
"syntax and tools, reducing user learning costs and usage thresholds."
msgstr ""
"DingoDB兼容MySQL协议，用户可以直接使用MySQL客户端访问DingoDB，无需学习新的"
"数据库语法和工具，降低用户的学习成本和使用门槛。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:42 4d5756aa76b64d98a6591835f6eb3d95
msgid "Horizontal Expansion and Contraction"
msgstr "水平扩缩容"

#: ../../source/index.rst:44 91a783c2fe1b4df98fc1fdd675f67178
msgid ""
"Based on the architecture design of storage and calculation separation, "
"DingoDB can achieve one-click horizontal expansion and contraction of "
"performance and resources, enabling enterprises to quickly adjust the "
"database scale according to business needs and effectively respond to "
"traffic changes."
msgstr ""
"基于存算分离的架构设计，DingoDB能够实现对性能和资源的一键水平扩容和缩容，使"
"得企业能够根据业务需求快速调整数据库规模，有效应对流量变化。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:46 5d84d8b47c474be6b3d597c1e07cbc44
msgid "Compatible with Multiple Storage Engines"
msgstr "多存储引擎兼容"

#: ../../source/index.rst:48 858c9662488e41b2b6882a782a4b17a0
msgid ""
"DingoDB supports multiple storage engines, enabling enterprises to choose "
"the most suitable storage engine according to business characteristics, "
"maximizing performance benefits."
msgstr ""
"DingoDB支持多种存储引擎，使得企业可以根据业务特点选择最适合的存储引擎，最大"
"化性能效益。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:50 5a84110535b1417d9b6f136a5ef0ac3d
msgid "Distributed Transaction Support"
msgstr "分布式事务支持"

#: ../../source/index.rst:52 f637c6f7372648fd888b47a08d78528d
msgid ""
"DingoDB supports distributed transactions that combine scalar and vector, "
"and provides multiple isolation levels, compatible with optimistic "
"transactions and pessimistic transactions, ensuring the integrity and "
"consistency of transactions in a distributed environment"
msgstr ""
"DingoDB支持标量向量融合的分布式事务，同时提供多种隔离级别，既兼容乐观事务和"
"悲观事务，确保事务在分布式环境下的完整性和一致性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:54 30119af97f80430fa267aae4fc7858ac
msgid "Multi-Tenant Support"
msgstr "多租户支持"

#: ../../source/index.rst:56 1e36ac52b22d4e69a3a3771a10d184a5
msgid ""
"DingoDB natively supports multi-tenancy, service isolation to prevent data "
"leakage and interference. Supports request-level dynamic flow control, "
"flexible resource allocation. Supports mixed storage and isolation by "
"tenant and resource group to ensure reasonable allocation and efficient "
"use of resources."
msgstr ""
"DingoDB原生支持多租户，服务隔离防止数据泄露与干扰。支持请求级动态流控，灵活"
"分配资源。支持混合存储与按租户和资源组隔离，确保资源的合理分配和高效利用。"

